WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.265
Welcome to Starting a Small Business. The best businesses solve a real problem.

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:11.326
Look for problems around you: what people complain about, or travel far for.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:16.110
Match them with your skills and resources, like tools, space or land.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.462
Choose an idea you can start small, with little money.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:23.938
Then test it: make a small batch, or take a few orders first.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:34.461
Before you move on, check: List three problems you see around you. Match them with your skills and resources. Score your ideas. Plan one small test.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:37.628
In the next lesson: Knowing your customer.
